  "notes": {
    "en": "Headline general-government finance aggregates from the FFA FS- and GFS-model dashboard. Level figures are in CHF million; the *quote (ratio) indicators are expressed as a share of GDP on a 0-1 scale. Years beyond the latest financial statement are budget / financial-plan or forecast figures (see the estimate dimension)."
